Changes for 2.4.0:

- Add settings manager with application and project scopes
- Speedup tree filtering
- Do not expand very large trees by default
- Do not generate JSON representation for very large trees
- Provide JSON import from the command line
- Implement ScopedCursor to address Wayland issues with application cursor override
- Build coverage with -O0 by selecting Debug over RelWithDebInfo
- Fix scalar value editing after the change of scalar type

Changes for 2.3.0:

- MISRA/Sonar quality round
- Implement controller to highlight the difference between different configuration trees
- Implement sync flag and allow to synchronize configuration trees between different editors
- Implement controller to synchronize difference in values of configuration trees
- Implement controller to synchronize collapse/expand status of trees in configuration panels
- Implement controller to synchronize tabs, scrollbars of configuration panels
- Implement prototype of DtoCompareView for configuration comparison
- Implement model and items to store configurations
- Implement new machinery for editors with splittable panels
- Implement new combo panels with trackable user focus
- Implement FileTreeView
- Refactor mime-data machinery to allow multiple objects in single mime object
- Modify VisibilityAgent so it can handle more than one target
- Fix ItemStackWidget for wrong index set

Changes for 2.2.0:

- Fix AnyValueEditor crash on attempt to set nullptr as initial value
- Remove default arguments from viewmodel virtual methods
- Switch to const in item selection/notification machinery
- Switch machinery to new ItemSelection class
- Implement helper methods to handle mime data for item copying
- Fix color engine for svg icon rendering when embedded in QTreeView
- Switch to a new "application restarter" machinery in AnyValue and SupDto editors.

Changes for 2.1.0:

- COA Release v3.3.0, January 2026
- Add a secondary toolbar with possibility to quickly add scalars
- Fix ItemStackWidget when mixture of widgets is added with/without guest actions

Changes for 2.0.0:

- COA Release v3.2.0
- Implement DetailedMessageBox
- Restructure project folder to exclude Sonar based controllers from Sonar analysis
- Implement AppCommandService and get rid of global functions to access commands
- Introduce interfaces for the machinery of context-aware proxy actions
- Provide possibility to setup individual widgets for setting editor
- Implement provider for stacked widgets
- Save SettingsModel in QSettings persistent storage in human-readable format

Changes for 1.9.0:

- Implement performance benchmarks for AnyValueItem transformation
- Remember custom struct/array typename during copy-and-paste operation
- Fix display name of array elements
- Implement AbstractTextContentController to generate JSON/XML model representation
- Enable field edit right after AnyValue was inserted in a struct
- Implement helper functions to center view to bottom level selection
- Allow to change scalar type after its creation via combo selector

Changes for 1.8.0:

- GitHub oac-tree 1.0 release
- Repair Ctrl+S shortcut to save projects
- Remove QObject inheritance from AnyValueActionHandler
- Provide possibility to filter-out children during copy-and-paste
- Provide support for copy-paste of several items
- Make CodeView XML/JSON text size scalable according to system font

Changes for 1.7.0:

- COA Release v3.0, CODAC Core System Release 7.3, March 2025
- Preserve field name while copy-and-paste structure fields
- Fix crash on attempt to copy-and-paste arrays containing int64
- Fix bug with two digits only while editing integers and floats
- Implement machinery for global application settings
- Implement collapse/expand status bar buttons for left and right panels
- Show overlay error message on JSON generation failure
- Implement machinery for overlay error messages

Changes for 1.6.0:

- COA Release v2.3, January 2025
- Round of Sonar/Misra/Parasoft code quality fixes
- Switch to Qt6 by default
- Support for dark themes
- Provide the saving of persistence settings for ItemStackWidget and CollapsibleListView
- Implement CustomSplitter
- Refactoring of icon rendering engine and icon find machinery
- Switch to new sup-mvvm project save/load machinery
- New waveform editor on board of sup-dto-editor for multiple waveforms
- Fix bug with project load when multiple documents are opened
- Switch to a new sup-mvvm clone machinery
